---
import { SiteLayout, with_base } from "../site/index.js";

const paths = [
  {
    name: "Writing",
    slug: "writing",
    blurb:
      "Unhinged fragments of a broken psyche, and pieces trying to reach their becoming. A writer is my main aspiration, however far-fetched it might be.",
  },
  {
    name: "Work",
    slug: "work",
    blurb:
      "The things I have built for others: original tools, enormous systems, simple websites… the list grows every day.",
  },
  {
    name: "About",
    slug: "about",
    blurb: "The creature tending this place, who Sol is, and how to find me.",
  },
];
---

<SiteLayout page_title="Our Hearth">
  <h1>Solarisael</h1>
  <p>
    Call me Sol, and try to enjoy the five minutes you can linger before going
    back to doom-scrolling.
  </p>
  <p>(I don’t judge you, I’d do the same hehe~)</p>
  <p>I am… a nobody above all else.</p>
  <p>We must never forget our origins after all.</p>
  <p>Many many years have I spent ignoring my reflection…</p>
  <p>It was like a ghost.</p>
  <p>Insistently trying, again and again.</p>
  <p>All it ever wanted was to warn me.</p>
  <p>
    To prevent me from becoming a simple man with too many regrets to count.
  </p>
  <p>
    This whole website is… a tiny… <strong>first step</strong>, let’s say. A
    public place to showcase everything that <strong>I was</strong>, that <strong
      >I am</strong
    >, and <strong>trying to be</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Consider this place a tiny grove for my <strong>work</strong>, <strong
      >thoughts</strong
    >, <strong>records</strong>, <strong>experiments</strong>, and the <strong
      >strange things</strong
    > that never quite got to becoming.
  </p>
  <p>
    I’d like it a lot if you critiqued my <strong>writing</strong>, in all its
    registers from <strong>unhinged</strong> to <strong
      >somewhat palatable</strong
    >.
  </p>
  <h2>Three Paths</h2>
  <ul>
    {
      paths.map((path) => (
        <li>
          <h3>
            <a href={with_base(path.slug)}>{path.name}</a>
          </h3>
          <p>{path.blurb}</p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</SiteLayout>
